import art.dl
import navigation.dl
import ../../packages/dynlex-ui/ui/scene_draws.dl

class:
    patterns:
        website Farm tile scenery
    members:
        ground as a pointer to UI scene object
        water as a pointer to UI scene object
        tree as a pointer to UI scene object
        stump as a pointer to UI scene object
        crop as a pointer to UI scene object
        crop key as an integer
        rocks as a pointer to UI scene object
        rock mask as an integer
        piles as (a pointer to UI scene object) array of 4 items
        pile keys as a string array of 4 items

class:
    patterns:
        website Farm landscape
    members:
        library as website farm art library
        objects as UI scene objects
        tiles as a pointer to website Farm tile scenery
        ground model as UI scene model
        water model as UI scene model
        stump model as UI scene model
        crop models as UI scene model array of 6 items
        item models as UI scene model array of 13 items
        egg models as UI scene model array of 6 items
        rock models as UI scene model array of 16 items
        barn as a pointer to UI scene object
        compost as a pointer to UI scene object

to get [the website Farm scene point at] {integer:x} {integer:y} [in] {a pointer to website farm world:world}:
    set tile to the website farm square at x y in world
    set height to tile's height
    if tile's terrain = 2:
        set height to height - 0.16
    return a UI scene vector from [(x - 9.5),height,(y - 9.5)]

to get [a website Farm scene model using] {UI scene mesh:mesh} [colored] {UI scene material:material} [casting shadow] {boolean:casts}:
    set part to a UI scene mesh part named "" under -1 using mesh with material material at (an identity UI scene pose)
    set part's casts shadow to casts
    return a UI scene model from [part]

to get [a website Farm object named] {a value:name} [using] {UI scene model:model} [in] {a pointer to website Farm landscape:landscape}:
    set object to a UI scene object named name with model model
    append object to (landscape's objects)
    return object

to [place website Farm object] {a pointer to UI scene object:object} [at] {vector:point} [sized] {an array:size}:
    set pose to an identity UI scene pose
    set pose's position to the UI scene vector form of point
    set pose's scale to a UI scene vector from size
    set UI scene root pose in (object's instance) to pose

to get [the website Farm ground paint for] {a pointer to website farm tile:tile}:
    if tile's terrain = 3:
        return UI ink from RGB (7495228 if tile's moisture > 3.0, else 10255437)
    if (tile's terrain = 1) or (tile's terrain = 2):
        return UI ink from RGB 9340769
    if tile's terrain = 4:
        return UI ink from RGB 12362358
    return UI ink from RGB 8428377

to get [the website Farm pond edge mask at] {integer:x} {integer:y} [in] {a pointer to website farm world:world}:
    set tile to the website farm square at x y in world
    if tile's terrain != 1:
        return 0
    set mask to 0
    set bit to 1
    for each step in [website farm point 0 -1,website farm point 1 0,website farm point 0 1,website farm point -1 0]:
        set xx to x + step's x
        set yy to y + step's y
        set edge to true
        if (0 <= xx < 20) and (0 <= yy < 20):
            set edge to (the website farm square at xx yy in world)'s terrain != 1
        if edge:
            set mask to mask | bit
        set bit to bit * 2
    return mask
